# Landing Page Tools Comparison

## 🎥 Demo
[https://youtu.be/Lj95Mm3LxDk]

## 🎯 Objective
Compare tools used for building landing pages.

## 🛠️ Tools Covered
- Carrd
- Hostinger Website Builder
- Replit
- Emergent

## ⚖️ Comparison

Carrd:
- Simple and fast
- Best for basic landing pages

Hostinger:
- More structured builder
- Good for beginners

Replit:
- Flexible
- Requires coding

Emergent:
- AI-based building
- Experimental and evolving

## 🚀 Key Learning
Choosing the right tool depends on use case, not popularity.
